## Test Execution Logs

### Unit Tests
```
✔ applies notebook category patches immediately (2.2838ms)
✔ deletes categories by uncategorizing or removing affected notebooks (3.3933ms)
✔ updates playlist queues for category deletion and item mutations (0.6012ms)
✔ applies study attempt stats optimistically (1.7356ms)
✔ buildOutlineTree nests headings under the nearest previous lower-level heading (2.2416ms)
✔ getExpandableOutlineKeys only returns items that have nested headings (0.7122ms)
✔ paginates items and exposes one-based result ranges (2.5402ms)
✔ clamps invalid pages and keeps empty lists on page one (0.3503ms)
✔ normalizes page sizes when calculating page counts (0.2291ms)
✔ builds compact page tokens with ellipses for long ranges (1.6445ms)
✔ normalizePlaybackText collapses whitespace and nbsp characters (1.5835ms)
✔ splitTextIntoSpeechChunks preserves ordered offsets within the normalized text (1.019ms)
✔ buildWordStartPositions returns the start index for each word (1.3769ms)
✔ findRangeIndexForOffset finds the matching range and clamps to edges (0.4633ms)
✔ getNextQueueIndex advances sequentially when shuffle is off (1.1657ms)
✔ getNextQueueIndex returns -1 at the end of a sequential queue (0.2102ms)
✔ getNextQueueIndex excludes the current item while shuffling (0.2143ms)
✔ getNextQueueIndex falls back to the persisted current index (0.1876ms)

Tests: 18 passed, 18 total
Duration: 387.8736ms
```

